message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: mneme
abstract: >-
  Vault-native memory plugin for Claude Code, Codex, and Antigravity.
  Markdown is the
  source of truth and the index is a rebuildable artifact. Ships SQLite
  FTS5 BM25 retrieval with an RRF-ready architecture, opt-in background
  compression with a cost cap, and a gated Graphiti knowledge graph.
type: software
authors:
